{"lyrics":"[00:04.22]Bitches be mad when they should be embarrassed\n[00:07.02](Purps On The Beat)\n[00:09.26]Haha, bitches be mad when they should be embarrassed\n[00:14.84]I need some Actavis, I just spilled Wock' on my wrist, fucked your bitch, I got lean on her tits\n[00:18.58]You bought a Challenger, I bought a Lamborghini, it came with windows tinted with the stick shift\n[00:22.38]I call my gun Actavis, it leave you leanin' like you bought a two liter and poured a ten\n[00:25.96]My hand on my ratchet, yes, I'm 'bout that action, it's not a pump action, it's .40 with extended clip\n[00:30.06]Yeah, Gucci is rare, they stop and stare\n[00:32.54]I remember pullin' up in the Cavalier\n[00:34.42]I remember drivin' off that drank, can't steer\n[00:36.22]Smokin' on loud pack, nigga, I can't hear (Yeah)\n[00:38.38]Louis is rare, they stop and stare\n[00:40.20]I remember pullin' up in the Cavalier\n[00:41.92]Can't drive off the drank, no, I can't steer\n[00:43.76]Smokin' on loud pack, nigga, I can't hear\n[00:45.48]We on the run, we on the hunt, keep shittin' on you niggas, I got the runs\n[00:49.46]Shit so damn much, I need some Tums, love the way my lil' bitch speak in tongues\n[00:53.34]Say you not the one and you got a gun, nigga, you ain't on shit 'til you go blow somethin'\n[00:57.06]If you really want smoke, let a nigga know somethin', my gun gay, it'll fuck you, then hit your ho up (Woo)\n[01:01.54]Bitch, I'ma do what I want to, my Draco come with a kick, hi-yah, I taught that bitch Kung-Fu, what you wanna do?\n[01:07.90]Like (Woo), huh, bitch, I'ma do what I want to (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[01:11.16]Peel that nigga's scalp back (Yeah), I treat that boy like a moon roof, zoom, zoom\n[01:15.40]Put a hole in his body, no Froot Loop, draco make him dance, tutu\n[01:19.54]They gon' make me blow my fuse, got these hatin'-ass bitches and niggas confused\n[01:23.14]I beat up the rap game and I give it a bruise, give 'em black and blues while I count up the blues\n[01:26.74]Got my hand on my tool, pop a couple of blues, then I pour up a pint, then I take me a snooze\n[01:29.98]I need some Actavis, I just spilled Wock' on my wrist, fucked your bitch, I got lean on her tits\n[01:34.18]You bought a Challenger, I bought a Lamborghini, it came with windows tinted with the stick shift\n[01:37.98]I call my gun Actavis, it leave you leanin' like you bought a two liter and poured a ten\n[01:41.54]My hand on my ratchet, yes, I'm 'bout that action, it's not a pump action, it's .40 with extended clip\n[01:45.96]Yeah, Gucci is rare, they stop and stare\n[01:48.16]I remember pullin' up in the Cavalier\n[01:49.94]I remember drivin' off that drank, can't steer\n[01:51.82]Smokin' on loud pack, nigga, I can't hear (Yeah)\n[01:54.00]Louis is rare, they stop and stare\n[01:55.76]I remember pullin' up in the Cavalier\n[01:57.52]Can't drive off the drank, no, I can't steer\n[01:59.36]Smokin' on loud pack, nigga, I can't hear","words":[[4.22,4.52,"Bitches"],[4.6,4.66,"be"],[4.8,5.12,"mad"],[5.18,5.28,"when"],[5.32,5.38,"they"],[5.48,5.6,"should"],[5.64,5.68,"be"],[5.8,6.48,"embarrassed"],[7.02,7.46,"(Purps"],[8.4,9.0,"On"],[9.08,9.12,"The"],[9.16,9.22,"Beat)"],[9.26,9.32,"Haha,"],[10.4,10.6,"bitches"],[10.66,10.7,"be"],[10.84,10.98,"mad"],[11.02,11.08,"when"],[11.12,11.28,"they"],[11.36,11.64,"should"],[11.68,11.7,"be"],[11.74,12.28,"embarrassed"],[14.84,14.84,"I"],[14.94,15.02,"need"],[15.08,15.22,"some"],[15.32,15.7,"Actavis,"],[15.74,15.74,"I"],[15.88,15.98,"just"],[16.02,16.18,"spilled"],[16.22,16.38,"Wock'"],[16.42,16.44,"on"],[16.52,16.62,"my"],[16.68,16.82,"wrist,"],[16.86,16.98,"fucked"],[17.02,17.08,"your"],[17.14,17.28,"bitch,"],[17.32,17.32,"I"],[17.42,17.54,"got"],[17.6,17.74,"lean"],[17.8,17.82,"on"],[17.88,18.0,"her"],[18.06,18.36,"tits"],[18.58,18.64,"You"],[18.72,18.86,"bought"],[18.9,18.9,"a"],[19.0,19.38,"Challenger,"],[19.42,19.42,"I"],[19.66,19.82,"bought"],[19.86,19.86,"a"],[19.96,20.46,"Lamborghini,"],[20.5,20.52,"it"],[20.58,20.74,"c